<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>Diseño Web para Psicólogos | MN Design Web</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Web para psicólogos con agenda online, videoconsulta cifrada y RGPD. Deja de gestionar citas por WhatsApp y llena tu agenda."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#EAF4FF" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href="/favicon_v2.webp" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter+Tight:wght@600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <!-- Activa animaciones solo si hay JS (sin JS todo se ve igual, sin ocultar nada) -->
    <script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add("js");</script>

    <!-- ===== ARCHIVO CSS ===== -->
    <style is:global>
      /* 1. TOKENS */
      :root {
        --bg: #ffffff;
        --soft: #f5f9fd;
        --sky: #e7f2ff;
        --sky2: #d3e8ff;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --ink: #0b1220;
        --ink2: #1d2939;
        --muted: #5d6b80;
        --line: #e5ecf4;
        --brand: #2f7cf6;
        --brand2: #62b6ff;
        --mint: #1fbf9f;
        --mint-bg: #dcf6ef;
        --mint-ink: #0b6b58;
        --btn: #0b1220;
        --btn-ink: #ffffff;
        --grad: linear-gradient(95deg, #2f7cf6 0%, #52a8ff 45%, #1fbf9f 100%);
        --sh-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 35, 70, 0.04), 0 8px 24px -8px rgba(15, 35, 70, 0.1);
        --sh-md: 0 2px 6px rgba(15, 35, 70, 0.05), 0 24px 48px -18px rgba(20, 60, 130, 0.22);
        --sh-lg: 0 4px 10px rgba(15, 35, 70, 0.06), 0 50px 90px -30px rgba(20, 70, 150, 0.4);
        --f-title: "Inter Tight", "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
        --f-body: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
        --ease: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
          --bg: #070d18;
          --soft: #0b1422;
          --sky: #0e1d33;
          --sky2: #12294a;
          --surface: #0f1a2b;
          --ink: #eef3fa;
          --ink2: #d7e1ee;
          --muted: #9aabc2;
          --line: #1d2b40;
          --brand: #5aa2ff;
          --mint-bg: #0f3a31;
          --mint-ink: #7fe0c6;
          --btn: #ffffff;
          --btn-ink: #0b1220;
        }
      }
      :root[data-theme="dark"] {
        --bg: #070d18;
        --soft: #0b1422;
        --sky: #0e1d33;
        --sky2: #12294a;
        --surface: #0f1a2b;
        --ink: #eef3fa;
        --ink2: #d7e1ee;
        --muted: #9aabc2;
        --line: #1d2b40;
        --brand: #5aa2ff;
        --mint-bg: #0f3a31;
        --mint-ink: #7fe0c6;
        --btn: #ffffff;
        --btn-ink: #0b1220;
      }

      /* 2. BASE */
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
        scroll-padding-top: 96px;
      }
      body {
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--ink);
        font: 400 1.03rem/1.65 var(--f-body);
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      h4 {
        font-family: var(--f-title);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.08;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      }
      a {
        color: inherit;
      }
      svg.i {
        width: 1.15em;
        height: 1.15em;
        fill: none;
        stroke: currentColor;
        stroke-width: 1.8;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
        flex: none;
      }
      .wrap {
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }
      section {
        padding: 120px 0;
        position: relative;
      }
      .center {
        text-align: center;
      }
      .center .lead,
      .center h2 {
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
      }
      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font: 600 0.8rem var(--f-body);
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--brand);
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .eyebrow::before {
        content: "";
        width: 18px;
        height: 2px;
        border-radius: 2px;
        background: var(--grad);
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.1rem);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        max-width: 780px;
      }
      .lead {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.12rem;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin-bottom: 60px;
      }
      .grad {
        background: var(--grad);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }
      .muted-word {
        color: #a5b3c6;
      }
      :focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 45%, transparent);
        outline-offset: 3px;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      /* 3. BOTONES (microinteracciones: elevación, brillo y flecha) */
      .btn {
        --bb: var(--btn);
        --bi: var(--btn-ink);
        position: relative;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 15px 26px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font: 600 0.98rem var(--f-body);
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        cursor: pointer;
        overflow: hidden;
        isolation: isolate;
        background: var(--bb);
        color: var(--bi);
        transition:
          transform 0.35s var(--ease),
          box-shadow 0.35s var(--ease),
          background 0.25s,
          border-color 0.25s,
          color 0.25s;
      }
      .btn::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: -1;
        background: linear-gradient(110deg, transparent 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) 50%, transparent 70%);
        transform: translateX(-110%);
        transition: transform 0.8s var(--ease);
      }
      .btn:hover::after {
        transform: translateX(110%);
      }
      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .btn:active {
        transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);
      }
      .btn .i {
        transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease);
      }
      .btn:hover .i-arrow {
        transform: translateX(4px);
      }
      .btn-main {
        box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -10px rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.55);
      }
      .btn-main:hover {
        box-shadow:
          0 18px 36px -12px rgba(47, 124, 246, 0.55),
          0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 14%, transparent);
      }
      .btn-brand {
        --bb: var(--brand);
        --bi: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 26px -10px rgba(47, 124, 246, 0.7);
      }
      .btn-ghost {
        --bb: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 80%, transparent);
        --bi: var(--ink);
        border-color: var(--line);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      }
      .btn-ghost:hover {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 50%, var(--line));
        color: var(--brand);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
      }
      .btn-ghost .play {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--sky);
        color: var(--brand);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease);
      }
      .btn-ghost:hover .play {
        transform: scale(1.12);
      }
      .btn-sm {
        padding: 10px 18px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      .micro {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      /* 4. NAVEGACIÓN (píldora de cristal) */
      .top {
        position: sticky;
        top: 12px;
        z-index: 50;
        padding: 0 16px;
      }
      .nav {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        height: 64px;
        padding: 0 20px 0 32px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 72%, transparent);
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 80%, transparent);
        backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(1.4);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
        transition: box-shadow 0.3s, background 0.3s;
      }
      .top.scrolled .nav {
        box-shadow: var(--sh-md);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 88%, transparent);
      }
      .logo {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        font: 700 1.2rem var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .logo i {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: var(--grad);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #fff;
        font: 800 1rem var(--f-title);
        font-style: normal;
      }
      .logo span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 4px;
      }
      .links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--muted);
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        transition: background 0.25s, color 0.25s;
      }
      .links a:hover {
        background: var(--sky);
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      /* Menú móvil: hamburguesa + panel flotante */
      .burger {
        display: none;
        position: relative;
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--ink);
        cursor: pointer;
        flex: none;
        transition: background 0.25s, border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s var(--ease);
      }
      .burger:hover {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 40%, var(--line));
      }
      .burger:active {
        transform: scale(0.94);
      }
      .burger span {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 50%;
        width: 18px;
        height: 2px;
        margin-left: -9px;
        border-radius: 2px;
        background: currentColor;
        transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), opacity 0.25s, width 0.3s var(--ease);
      }
      .burger span:nth-child(1) {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
      }
      .burger span:nth-child(3) {
        width: 12px;
        transform: translateY(6px);
      }
      .burger[aria-expanded="true"] {
        background: var(--btn);
        color: var(--btn-ink);
        border-color: var(--btn);
      }
      .burger[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(1) {
        transform: rotate(45deg);
      }
      .burger[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2) {
        opacity: 0;
      }
      .burger[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(3) {
        width: 18px;
        transform: rotate(-45deg);
      }
      .mnav {
        display: none;
      }

      /* 5. HERO CENTRADO + TRÍO DE IPHONES */
      .hero {
        margin-top: -76px;
        padding: 150px 0 40px;
        text-align: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        background:
          radial-gradient(60% 50% at 50% 0%, var(--sky2), transparent 70%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, var(--sky) 0%, var(--bg) 78%);
      }
      .hero::before {
        /* nubes suaves de color */
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
          radial-gradient(420px 260px at 12% 30%, rgba(98, 182, 255, 0.22), transparent 70%),
          radial-gradient(420px 260px at 88% 22%, rgba(31, 191, 159, 0.14), transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 6px 6px 6px 8px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 80%, transparent);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.35s;
      }
      .badge:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-md);
      }
      .avs {
        display: flex;
      }
      .avs b {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 2px solid var(--surface);
        margin-left: -8px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .avs b:first-child {
        margin-left: 0;
      }
      .badge .stars {
        color: #f5b21b;
        display: inline-flex;
      }
      .badge em {
        font-style: normal;
        background: var(--brand);
        color: #fff;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6.2vw, 4.6rem);
        max-width: 960px;
        margin: 0 auto 24px;
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      }
      .hero .sub {
        font-size: 1.16rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 620px;
        margin: 0 auto 36px;
      }
      .cta-row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .stage {
        position: relative;
        height: 560px;
        margin-top: 64px;
        perspective: 1400px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .halo {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 60px;
        width: 760px;
        height: 760px;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9) 0 28%, transparent 29%),
          radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand2) 45%, transparent), transparent 62%);
        opacity: 0.8;
      }
      .halo::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 90px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 30%, transparent);
        animation: spin 60s linear infinite;
      }
      @keyframes spin {
        to {
          transform: rotate(360deg);
        }
      }
      .trio {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        transform-style: preserve-3d;
        transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease);
      }
      .trio .iphone {
        position: absolute;
        top: 30px;
        left: 50%;
      }
      .trio .p-l {
        --w: 230px;
        transform: translateX(-138%) translateY(70px) rotate(-9deg);
      }
      .trio .p-r {
        --w: 230px;
        transform: translateX(38%) translateY(70px) rotate(9deg);
      }
      .trio .p-c {
        --w: 262px;
        top: 0;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        z-index: 2;
        box-shadow: var(--sh-lg);
      }
      .float {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 3;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 10px 14px 10px 10px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 88%, transparent);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-md);
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
        animation: bob 6s ease-in-out infinite;
      }
      .float b {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }
      .float span {
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .float .ico {
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        border-radius: 11px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #fff;
        background: var(--grad);
      }
      .float.f1 {
        left: 4%;
        top: 90px;
      }
      .float.f2 {
        right: 3%;
        top: 200px;
        animation-delay: -2s;
      }
      .float.f3 {
        left: 9%;
        top: 360px;
        animation-delay: -4s;
      }
      .float.f2 .ico {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1fbf9f, #52d6b8);
      }
      .float.f3 .ico {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1220, #33415c);
      }
      @keyframes bob {
        50% {
          transform: translateY(-10px);
        }
      }
      .stage-fade {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        height: 180px;
        z-index: 4;
        background: linear-gradient(transparent, var(--bg));
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      /* Tira de funciones (marquee) */
      .ticker-t {
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 28px 0 18px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 5;
      }
      .marquee {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 12%, #000 88%, transparent);
        mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 12%, #000 88%, transparent);
      }
      .track {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        width: max-content;
        animation: slide 38s linear infinite;
      }
      .marquee:hover .track {
        animation-play-state: paused;
      }
      @keyframes slide {
        to {
          transform: translateX(-50%);
        }
      }
      .pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 10px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        white-space: nowrap;
        transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease), border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
      }
      .pill .i {
        color: var(--brand);
      }
      .pill:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 40%, var(--line));
        box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
      }

      /* 6. LOGOS DE CLÍNICAS (placeholders) */
      .logos {
        padding: 56px 0 24px;
      }
      .logos p {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 26px;
      }
      .logos .track {
        gap: 56px;
        animation-duration: 44s;
      }
      .lg {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font: 700 1.12rem var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: #9aa8bb;
        white-space: nowrap;
        filter: grayscale(1);
        opacity: 0.8;
        transition: color 0.3s, opacity 0.3s, filter 0.3s, transform 0.3s var(--ease);
      }
      .lg svg {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        fill: currentColor;
      }
      .lg:hover {
        color: var(--brand);
        filter: none;
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1.05);
      }

      /* 7. COMPONENTES DE DISPOSITIVO (reutilizables)
         Para usar capturas reales: sustituye el contenido de .scr por
         <img src="/tu-captura.webp" alt="..." /> (object-fit: cover ya está aplicado). */
      .iphone {
        --w: 240px;
        position: relative;
        width: var(--w);
        aspect-ratio: 9 / 19.3;
        font-size: calc(var(--w) * 0.05);
        border-radius: calc(var(--w) * 0.17);
        padding: calc(var(--w) * 0.035);
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, #2a3342, #0b1220 40%, #1b2331);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-md), inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.6s var(--ease);
      }
      .iphone::before {
        /* isla dinámica */
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: calc(var(--w) * 0.06);
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 30%;
        height: calc(var(--w) * 0.075);
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: #05080f;
        z-index: 3;
      }
      .scr {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: calc(var(--w) * 0.14);
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eef6ff, #ffffff 40%);
        color: #0b1220;
        padding: 3.4em 1.1em 1.1em;
        text-align: left;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-family: var(--f-body);
      }
      .scr img,
      .lscr img,
      .tscr img {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
      .sb {
        position: absolute;
        top: 1.05em;
        left: 1.6em;
        right: 1.6em;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        font-size: 0.78em;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .scr small {
        font-size: 0.78em;
        color: #6b7a90;
      }
      .scr h4 {
        font-size: 1.35em;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        margin: 0.1em 0 0.7em;
      }
      .ui-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e6edf5;
        border-radius: 1.1em;
        padding: 0.8em;
        margin-bottom: 0.6em;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 14px -8px rgba(20, 50, 100, 0.25);
      }
      .ui-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6em;
        font-size: 0.82em;
        padding: 0.55em 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
      }
      .ui-row:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }
      .ui-row b {
        flex: 1;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .ui-row time {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #2f7cf6;
        width: 3.2em;
      }
      .tag {
        font-size: 0.8em;
        font-weight: 700;
        padding: 0.2em 0.7em;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: #e7f2ff;
        color: #2f7cf6;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .tag.ok {
        background: #dcf6ef;
        color: #0b6b58;
      }
      .tag.warn {
        background: #fff3d6;
        color: #9a6500;
      }
      .next {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2f7cf6, #62b6ff);
        color: #fff;
        border-radius: 1.2em;
        padding: 1em;
        margin-bottom: 0.7em;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -10px rgba(47, 124, 246, 0.8);
      }
      .next small {
        color: #dcecff;
      }
      .next b {
        display: block;
        font: 700 1.3em var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin: 0.15em 0 0.7em;
      }
      .next span {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.4em;
        background: #fff;
        color: #2f7cf6;
        border-radius: 99px;
        font-size: 0.85em;
        font-weight: 700;
        padding: 0.55em;
      }
      .ui-btn {
        display: block;
        text-align: center;
        background: #0b1220;
        color: #fff;
        border-radius: 99px;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 0.85em;
        padding: 0.75em;
        margin-top: 0.6em;
      }
      .days {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
        gap: 0.35em;
        margin-bottom: 0.8em;
      }
      .days span {
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 0.8em;
        padding: 0.45em 0;
        font-size: 0.75em;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e6edf5;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }
      .days span b {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.3em;
      }
      .days span.on {
        background: #0b1220;
        color: #fff;
        border-color: #0b1220;
      }
      .slots {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0.4em;
      }
      .slots span {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.8em;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 0.6em 0;
        border-radius: 0.8em;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e6edf5;
      }
      .slots span.on {
        background: #e7f2ff;
        border-color: #2f7cf6;
        color: #2f7cf6;
      }
      .slots span.off {
        color: #b6c1cf;
        text-decoration: line-through;
      }
      .noti {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.6em;
        align-items: flex-start;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        border-radius: 1.1em;
        padding: 0.7em;
        margin-bottom: 0.5em;
        font-size: 0.8em;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 16px -10px rgba(10, 30, 70, 0.4);
      }
      .noti i {
        width: 2.2em;
        height: 2.2em;
        border-radius: 0.7em;
        flex: none;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #fff;
        font-style: normal;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2f7cf6, #62b6ff);
      }
      .noti i svg {
        width: 1.2em;
        height: 1.2em;
      }
      .noti b {
        display: block;
      }
      .noti span {
        color: #5d6b80;
      }
      .scr.lock {
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, #a9d3ff, #e7f2ff 45%, #d6f5ec);
      }
      .clock-big {
        text-align: center;
        font: 700 3.4em/1 var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        color: #0b1220;
        margin: 0.2em 0 0.1em;
      }
      .scr.lock .date {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.85em;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1.4em;
        color: #33415c;
      }
      .scr.vid {
        background: #0b1220;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .vid-main {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
          radial-gradient(60% 45% at 50% 38%, #3d6fb8, transparent 70%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #1c3354, #0b1220);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
      }
      .av-big {
        width: 7em;
        height: 7em;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font: 700 2.2em var(--f-title);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8ab8ff, #2f7cf6);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.5em rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), 0 0 0 1.1em rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      }
      .vid-self {
        position: absolute;
        right: 1em;
        top: 3.4em;
        width: 32%;
        aspect-ratio: 3/4;
        border-radius: 1em;
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, #7ad9c1, #1fbf9f);
        border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font: 700 1.2em var(--f-title);
      }
      .vid-top {
        position: absolute;
        top: 3.2em;
        left: 1em;
        font-size: 0.78em;
      }
      .vid-top b {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.15em;
      }
      .e2e {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.35em;
        margin-top: 0.4em;
        padding: 0.25em 0.7em;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: rgba(31, 191, 159, 0.22);
        color: #7fe0c6;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .e2e svg {
        width: 1em;
        height: 1em;
      }
      .vid-ctrl {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 1.6em;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.7em;
      }
      .vid-ctrl span {
        width: 2.8em;
        height: 2.8em;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      }
      .vid-ctrl span svg {
        width: 1.2em;
        height: 1.2em;
      }
      .vid-ctrl span.end {
        background: #ef4444;
        width: 3.6em;
        border-radius: 99px;
      }
      .field {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e6edf5;
        border-radius: 0.8em;
        padding: 0.55em 0.75em;
        font-size: 0.78em;
        margin-bottom: 0.45em;
      }
      .field small {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.85em;
      }
      .field b {
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .sign {
        height: 4.2em;
        border: 1.5px dashed #b9cbe2;
        border-radius: 0.9em;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        margin: 0.5em 0;
        background: #fbfdff;
      }
      .sign svg {
        width: 70%;
        height: 70%;
        stroke: #2f7cf6;
        stroke-width: 2;
        fill: none;
        stroke-linecap: round;
      }
      .pay-amt {
        text-align: center;
        font: 700 2.6em var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        margin: 0.3em 0 0.1em;
      }
      .pay-ok {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 3.4em;
        height: 3.4em;
        border-radius: 50%;
        margin: 0.4em auto 0.6em;
        background: #dcf6ef;
        color: #0b6b58;
      }
      .pay-ok svg {
        width: 1.6em;
        height: 1.6em;
        stroke-width: 2.4;
      }

      /* Portátil */
      .laptop {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
      }
      .lid {
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, #2a3342, #0b1220);
        border-radius: 18px 18px 6px 6px;
        padding: 12px 12px 14px;
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      }
      .lscr {
        position: relative;
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #f6f9fd;
        color: #0b1220;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 17% 1fr;
        font-size: clamp(8px, 1vw, 12px);
      }
      .base {
        height: 14px;
        width: 116%;
        margin-left: -8%;
        background: linear-gradient(#e3e9f0, #a9b6c3);
        border-radius: 0 0 20px 20px;
        position: relative;
      }
      .base::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 0;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 16%;
        height: 5px;
        border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
        background: #c3ccd7;
      }
      .side {
        background: #0f1b2e;
        padding: 1.4em 1em;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.9em;
      }
      .side i {
        display: block;
        height: 0.8em;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      }
      .side i:first-child {
        width: 60%;
        height: 1.6em;
        border-radius: 0.5em;
        background: var(--grad);
        margin-bottom: 0.6em;
      }
      .side i:nth-child(2) {
        background: rgba(98, 182, 255, 0.6);
      }
      .dash {
        padding: 1.4em 1.6em;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .dash-h {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 1.1em;
      }
      .dash-h b {
        font: 700 1.4em var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .kpis {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 0.8em;
        margin-bottom: 1em;
      }
      .kpi {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e6edf5;
        border-radius: 0.9em;
        padding: 0.8em 1em;
      }
      .kpi b {
        display: block;
        font: 700 1.5em var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }
      .kpi span {
        font-size: 0.85em;
        color: #6b7a90;
      }
      .kpi .bar {
        height: 0.35em;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: #edf2f7;
        margin-top: 0.5em;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .kpi .bar i {
        display: block;
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: var(--grad);
      }
      .dash .ui-row {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e6edf5;
        border-radius: 0.8em;
        padding: 0.65em 0.9em;
        margin-bottom: 0.45em;
        font-size: 1em;
      }
      .dash .ui-row.free {
        border-style: dashed;
        color: #6b7a90;
        background: transparent;
      }

      /* Tablet (horizontal) */
      .tablet {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 12px;
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, #2a3342, #0b1220 45%, #1b2331);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-md), inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      }
      .tscr {
        position: relative;
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
        border-radius: 18px;
        overflow: hidden;
        font-size: clamp(8px, 1vw, 12px);
      }

      /* 8. REVELADO AL HACER SCROLL */
      html.js .rv {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(28px);
        transition:
          opacity 0.9s var(--ease),
          transform 0.9s var(--ease);
        transition-delay: var(--d, 0s);
      }
      html.js .rv.in {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
      }

      /* 9. TARJETAS (hover con foco de luz que sigue al cursor) */
      .card {
        position: relative;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 32px;
        overflow: hidden;
        isolation: isolate;
        transition:
          transform 0.5s var(--ease),
          box-shadow 0.5s var(--ease),
          border-color 0.4s;
      }
      .card::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: -1;
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.4s;
        background: radial-gradient(360px circle at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 0%), color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand2) 16%, transparent), transparent 70%);
      }
      .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-md);
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 28%, var(--line));
      }
      .card:hover::before {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      .card h3 {
        font-size: 1.28rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .card p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.98rem;
      }
      .ico-box {
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: var(--sky);
        color: var(--brand);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease), background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
      }
      .card:hover .ico-box {
        transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1.08);
        background: var(--brand);
        color: #fff;
      }

      /* 10. PROBLEMA */
      .audience {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: -24px 0 64px;
      }
      .audience span {
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: all 0.3s var(--ease);
        cursor: default;
      }
      .audience span:hover {
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--bg);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .pains {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .pains .card {
        padding: 22px 22px 28px;
      }
      .mini {
        min-height: 150px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--sky), var(--soft));
        padding: 16px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 6px;
        overflow: hidden;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: #0b1220;
      }
      .bub {
        max-width: 82%;
        padding: 6px 11px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 3px 10px -6px rgba(10, 30, 70, 0.4);
        transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease);
      }
      .bub.out {
        align-self: flex-end;
        background: #2f7cf6;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .card:hover .bub:nth-child(odd) {
        transform: translateX(4px);
      }
      .card:hover .bub:nth-child(even) {
        transform: translateX(-4px);
      }
      .slot {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 8px 10px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .slot.x {
        color: #b4432f;
      }
      .slot.x s {
        text-decoration-color: #b4432f88;
      }
      .wfm {
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 12px;
      }
      .wfm i {
        display: block;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: #e6edf5;
        margin-bottom: 7px;
      }
      .wfm i:nth-child(1) {
        width: 45%;
        background: #cfd9e4;
      }
      .wfm i:nth-child(3) {
        width: 70%;
      }
      .wfm small {
        color: #6b7a90;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
      }
      .lockv {
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }
      .lockv .big {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: #fff;
        color: #b4432f;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -10px rgba(180, 67, 47, 0.6);
        transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease), color 0.3s;
      }
      .lockv .big svg {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
      }
      .card:hover .lockv .big {
        transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-6deg);
        color: #0b6b58;
      }
      .bridge {
        text-align: center;
        font: 600 1.35rem/1.4 var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 64px auto 0;
      }

      /* 11. BENEFICIOS: ABANICO DE 5 MÓVILES */
      .benefits {
        overflow: hidden;
        background:
          radial-gradient(50% 60% at 50% 70%, var(--sky2), transparent 75%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), var(--sky) 60%, var(--bg));
      }
      .fan {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: flex-end;
        gap: 0;
        margin-top: 10px;
        padding: 30px 0 10px;
      }
      .fan figure {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        margin: 0 -18px;
        transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease), z-index 0s;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .fan figure:nth-child(1) {
        transform: translateY(70px) rotate(-6deg);
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .fan figure:nth-child(2) {
        transform: translateY(30px) rotate(-3deg);
        z-index: 2;
      }
      .fan figure:nth-child(3) {
        z-index: 3;
      }
      .fan figure:nth-child(4) {
        transform: translateY(30px) rotate(3deg);
        z-index: 2;
      }
      .fan figure:nth-child(5) {
        transform: translateY(70px) rotate(6deg);
        z-index: 1;
      }
      .fan figure:nth-child(odd):not(:nth-child(3)) .iphone {
        --w: 200px;
      }
      .fan figure:nth-child(even) .iphone {
        --w: 224px;
      }
      .fan figure:nth-child(3) .iphone {
        --w: 256px;
        box-shadow: var(--sh-lg);
      }
      .fan figure:hover {
        z-index: 5;
        transform: translateY(-14px) rotate(0) scale(1.03);
      }
      .fan figure:hover .iphone {
        box-shadow: var(--sh-lg);
      }
      .fan figcaption {
        margin-top: 18px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
        transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
      }
      .fan figcaption .i {
        color: var(--brand);
      }
      .fan figure:hover figcaption {
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--bg);
      }
      .fan figure:hover figcaption .i {
        color: var(--brand2);
      }
      .ben-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 100px;
      }
      .cap-note {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      /* 12. CONSULTA DIGITAL: BENTO CON DISPOSITIVOS */
      .bento {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
      }
      .bento .card {
        padding: 34px;
      }
      .s2 {
        grid-column: span 2;
      }
      .s3 {
        grid-column: span 3;
      }
      .s4 {
        grid-column: span 4;
      }
      .s6 {
        grid-column: span 6;
      }
      .bx-hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
        gap: 36px;
        align-items: center;
        background:
          radial-gradient(500px 300px at 90% 10%, var(--sky2), transparent 70%),
          linear-gradient(160deg, var(--sky), var(--surface) 70%);
      }
      .dev-stack {
        position: relative;
        padding: 10px 40px 24px 0;
        transition: transform 0.7s var(--ease);
      }
      .card:hover .dev-stack {
        transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.01);
      }
      .dev-stack .iphone {
        --w: 132px;
        position: absolute;
        right: 0;
        bottom: -6px;
        box-shadow: var(--sh-lg);
        transition: transform 0.7s var(--ease);
      }
      .card:hover .dev-stack .iphone {
        transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(3deg);
      }
      .bx-dark {
        background: linear-gradient(165deg, #0b1220, #14264a);
        border: 0;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .bx-dark h3 {
        color: #fff;
      }
      .bx-dark p {
        color: #a9bcd6;
      }
      .bx-dark .ico-box {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        color: #7fe0c6;
      }
      .bx-dark .tablet {
        margin-top: 26px;
        transition: transform 0.7s var(--ease);
      }
      .bx-dark:hover .tablet {
        transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-1deg);
      }
      .vid-grid {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0.5em;
        padding: 0.5em;
        background: #0b1220;
      }
      .vid-grid > div {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 0.9em;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font: 700 2em var(--f-title);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .vid-grid > div:nth-child(1) {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #4e86d8, #1c3354);
      }
      .vid-grid > div:nth-child(2) {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #56cfb2, #144a45);
      }
      .vid-grid small {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0.7em;
        top: 0.6em;
        font: 600 0.4em var(--f-body);
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        padding: 0.3em 0.7em;
        border-radius: 99px;
      }
      .tscr .vid-ctrl {
        bottom: 1em;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .tscr .e2e {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 4.2em;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        margin: 0;
        background: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.6);
        backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        font-size: 0.85em;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .toast-demo {
        margin-top: 22px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .toast-demo .noti {
        background: var(--soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        box-shadow: none;
        color: var(--ink);
        transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease);
      }
      .toast-demo .noti span {
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .card:hover .toast-demo .noti:first-child {
        transform: translateX(6px);
      }
      .card:hover .toast-demo .noti:last-child {
        transform: translateX(-6px);
      }
      .bx-mint {
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--mint-bg), var(--surface));
      }
      .bx-mint .ico-box {
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--mint-ink);
      }
      .pay-demo {
        margin-top: 22px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      .pay-demo b {
        font: 700 1.3rem var(--f-title);
      }
      .form-demo {
        margin-top: 22px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #0b1220;
      }
      .form-demo .field {
        background: var(--soft);
        border-color: var(--line);
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .progress {
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: var(--line);
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-top: 10px;
      }
      .progress i {
        display: block;
        height: 100%;
        width: 66%;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: var(--grad);
        transition: width 1s var(--ease);
      }
      .card:hover .progress i {
        width: 100%;
      }
      .bx-int {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 36px;
        align-items: center;
        background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--sky), var(--soft));
      }
      .hub {
        position: relative;
        height: 210px;
      }
      .hub .core {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        width: 76px;
        height: 76px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #fff;
        font: 800 1.2rem var(--f-title);
        background: var(--grad);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 12%, transparent), var(--sh-md);
        z-index: 2;
      }
      .hub .ring {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 50%;
        width: 190px;
        height: 190px;
        margin: -95px 0 0 -95px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 40%, transparent);
        animation: spin 40s linear infinite;
      }
      .hub .pill {
        position: absolute;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        padding: 7px 13px;
        box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
      }
      .hub .pill:nth-of-type(1) {
        left: 2%;
        top: 12%;
      }
      .hub .pill:nth-of-type(2) {
        right: 0;
        top: 6%;
      }
      .hub .pill:nth-of-type(3) {
        left: 0;
        bottom: 12%;
      }
      .hub .pill:nth-of-type(4) {
        right: 4%;
        bottom: 6%;
      }
      .hub .pill:nth-of-type(5) {
        left: 50%;
        bottom: -8px;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
      }
      .hub .pill:nth-of-type(5):hover {
        transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-2px);
      }
      .opt {
        margin-top: 28px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .opt b {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      /* 13. TIMELINE VERTICAL INTERACTIVO */
      .process {
        background:
          radial-gradient(700px 400px at 0% 10%, var(--sky), transparent 70%),
          radial-gradient(600px 400px at 100% 90%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--mint-bg) 70%, transparent), transparent 70%),
          var(--soft);
      }
      .tl {
        --p: 0;
        position: relative;
        max-width: 980px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .tl-line {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        width: 3px;
        margin-left: -1.5px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        background: var(--line);
      }
      .tl-line i {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: calc(var(--p) * 100%);
        border-radius: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2f7cf6, #62b6ff, #1fbf9f);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(47, 124, 246, 0.55);
        position: relative;
      }
      .tl-line i::after {
        /* cometa en la punta de la línea */
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -6px;
        left: 50%;
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        margin-left: -6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(47, 124, 246, 0.35), 0 0 22px 6px rgba(47, 124, 246, 0.6);
      }
      .tl-item {
        position: relative;
        width: 50%;
        padding: 0 56px 56px 0;
      }
      .tl-item:nth-child(odd) {
        margin-left: 50%;
        padding: 0 0 56px 56px;
      }
      .tl-item:last-child {
        padding-bottom: 0;
      }
      .tl-item + .tl-item {
        margin-top: -120px; /* escalonado: cada tarjeta empieza a media altura de la anterior */
      }
      .tl-node {
        position: absolute;
        top: 26px;
        right: -22px;
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font: 700 0.95rem var(--f-title);
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 2px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--muted);
        z-index: 2;
        transition: all 0.5s var(--ease);
      }
      .tl-item:nth-child(odd) .tl-node {
        right: auto;
        left: -22px;
      }
      .tl-item.on .tl-node {
        background: var(--brand);
        border-color: var(--brand);
        color: #fff;
        box-shadow:
          0 0 0 7px color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 18%, transparent),
          0 0 24px color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 60%, transparent);
      }
      .tl-item.current .tl-node::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: -8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 2px solid var(--brand);
        animation: ping 1.8s var(--ease) infinite;
      }
      @keyframes ping {
        from {
          transform: scale(0.8);
          opacity: 0.9;
        }
        to {
          transform: scale(1.6);
          opacity: 0;
        }
      }
      .tl-card {
        width: 100%;
        text-align: left;
        font: inherit;
        color: inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
        opacity: 0.55;
        transform: translateY(12px) scale(0.98);
        transition:
          opacity 0.6s var(--ease),
          transform 0.6s var(--ease),
          box-shadow 0.5s var(--ease),
          border-color 0.4s;
      }
      html:not(.js) .tl-card,
      .tl-item.on .tl-card {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
      }
      .tl-item.on .tl-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
      }
      .tl-item.current .tl-card {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 40%, var(--line));
        box-shadow: var(--sh-md);
      }
      .tl-card .wk {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--brand);
        background: var(--sky);
        padding: 5px 12px;
        border-radius: 99px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }
      .tl-more {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-rows: 0fr;
        transition: grid-template-rows 0.5s var(--ease);
      }
      .tl-more > div {
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .tl-card[aria-expanded="true"] .tl-more {
        grid-template-rows: 1fr;
      }
      .tl-more ul {
        list-style: none;
        padding-top: 16px;
        margin-top: 16px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .tl-more li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        padding: 4px 0;
      }
      .tl-more li .i {
        color: var(--mint);
      }
      .tl-toggle {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        margin-top: 14px;
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--brand);
      }
      .tl-toggle .i {
        transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease);
      }
      .tl-card[aria-expanded="true"] .tl-toggle .i {
        transform: rotate(45deg);
      }
      .tl-count {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 56px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .tl-count b {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      /* 14. PLANES */
      .plans {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 22px;
        max-width: 960px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .plan {
        padding: 40px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .plan .ptag {
        align-self: flex-start;
        background: var(--sky);
        color: var(--brand);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        padding: 5px 14px;
        border-radius: 99px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .plan h3 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }
      .price {
        font: 800 2.6rem var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        margin: 14px 0 6px;
      }
      .price small {
        display: block;
        font: 400 0.92rem var(--f-body);
        letter-spacing: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .plan > p {
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }
      .plan ul {
        list-style: none;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        flex: 1;
      }
      .plan li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 8px 0;
        font-size: 0.97rem;
      }
      .plan li .ck {
        width: 22px;
        height: 22px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        flex: none;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: var(--mint-bg);
        color: var(--mint-ink);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-top: 2px;
      }
      .plan .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
      .plan.hot {
        background:
          radial-gradient(400px 260px at 100% 0%, rgba(98, 182, 255, 0.35), transparent 70%),
          linear-gradient(165deg, #0b1220, #172a4d);
        border: 0;
        color: #fff;
        box-shadow: var(--sh-lg);
      }
      .plan.hot p,
      .plan.hot .price small {
        color: #a9bcd6;
      }
      .plan.hot .ptag {
        background: var(--grad);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .plan.hot li .ck {
        background: rgba(127, 224, 198, 0.18);
        color: #7fe0c6;
      }
      .plan.hot .btn {
        --bb: #fff;
        --bi: #0b1220;
      }

      /* 15. AUTORIDAD: TESTIMONIOS + DEMOS */
      .proof-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.3fr 1fr;
        grid-template-rows: auto auto;
        gap: 18px;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .rating {
        grid-row: span 2;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        background:
          radial-gradient(300px 200px at 0% 0%, var(--sky2), transparent 70%),
          var(--surface);
      }
      .rating .score {
        font: 800 4.6rem/1 var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }
      .rating .score span {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }
      .stars5 {
        display: flex;
        gap: 3px;
        color: #f5b21b;
        margin: 12px 0 8px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      .g-badge {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 14px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: var(--soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        margin-top: 28px;
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
      }
      .g-badge .g {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: #fff;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font: 800 1.1rem var(--f-title);
        box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
        flex: none;
      }
      .g-badge .g span {
        background: conic-gradient(#ea4335 0 25%, #fbbc05 0 50%, #34a853 0 75%, #4285f4 0);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }
      .trust-list {
        list-style: none;
        margin-top: 22px;
        display: grid;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }
      .trust-list li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .trust-list .i {
        color: var(--mint);
      }
      .quote.feat {
        grid-row: span 2;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0b1220, #172a4d);
        color: #fff;
        border: 0;
      }
      .quote.feat blockquote {
        font: 600 clamp(1.4rem, 2.4vw, 1.9rem) / 1.3 var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        margin: 22px 0 32px;
      }
      .qmark {
        font: 800 5rem/0.6 var(--f-title);
        background: var(--grad);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        height: 40px;
      }
      .quote blockquote {
        font-size: 1.04rem;
        margin: 12px 0 22px;
      }
      .who {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .who .av {
        width: 46px;
        height: 46px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #fff;
        font: 700 0.95rem var(--f-title);
        background: var(--grad);
        flex: none;
        transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease);
      }
      .quote:hover .who .av {
        transform: scale(1.08);
      }
      .who b {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.98rem;
      }
      .who span {
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        display: inline-flex;
        gap: 6px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .quote.feat .who span {
        color: #a9bcd6;
      }
      .verified {
        color: var(--mint);
      }
      .quote .stars5 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .demos-h {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: end;
        gap: 20px;
        margin: 90px 0 26px;
        text-align: left;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .demos-h h3 {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
      }
      .demos {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .demo {
        padding: 12px 12px 18px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }
      .browser {
        border-radius: 14px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        background: var(--soft);
      }
      .browser .bar {
        display: flex;
        gap: 5px;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 8px 10px;
        background: var(--surface);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .browser .bar i {
        width: 7px;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #d6dee8;
      }
      .browser .bar span {
        flex: 1;
        height: 12px;
        margin-left: 6px;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: var(--soft);
      }
      /* Placeholder de captura: sustituye .site por <img src="/captura-demo.webp"> */
      .site {
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 11;
        padding: 12px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, hsl(var(--h) 70% 94%), hsl(var(--h) 55% 86%));
        transition: transform 0.7s var(--ease);
      }
      .demo:hover .site {
        transform: scale(1.04);
      }
      .site i {
        display: block;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: hsl(var(--h) 35% 40% / 0.35);
      }
      .site i:nth-child(1) {
        width: 30%;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .site i:nth-child(2) {
        width: 80%;
        height: 12px;
        background: hsl(var(--h) 40% 25% / 0.7);
      }
      .site i:nth-child(3) {
        width: 60%;
      }
      .site i:nth-child(4) {
        width: 34%;
        height: 16px;
        border-radius: 99px;
        margin-top: 6px;
        background: hsl(var(--h) 60% 45%);
      }
      .site i:nth-child(5) {
        flex: 1;
        margin-top: 8px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: hsl(var(--h) 50% 98% / 0.8);
      }
      .demo b {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0 6px;
        font-size: 0.97rem;
      }
      .demo b .i {
        color: var(--brand);
        transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease);
      }
      .demo:hover b .i {
        transform: translate(3px, -3px);
      }

      /* 16. FAQ (dos columnas como la referencia) */
      .faq-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
        gap: 60px;
        align-items: start;
      }
      .faq-side {
        position: sticky;
        top: 110px;
      }
      .ask {
        margin-top: 30px;
        background:
          radial-gradient(260px 180px at 100% 0%, var(--sky2), transparent 70%),
          var(--surface);
      }
      .ask h3 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }
      .ask .btn {
        margin-top: 18px;
      }
      details {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.4s var(--ease), transform 0.4s var(--ease);
      }
      details:hover {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 30%, var(--line));
        transform: translateX(4px);
      }
      details[open] {
        box-shadow: var(--sh-md);
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 30%, var(--line));
        transform: none;
      }
      summary {
        cursor: pointer;
        list-style: none;
        padding: 20px 64px 20px 24px;
        font: 600 1.02rem var(--f-title);
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        position: relative;
      }
      summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }
      summary::after {
        content: "+";
        position: absolute;
        right: 18px;
        top: 50%;
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        margin-top: -15px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: var(--sky);
        color: var(--brand);
        font: 400 1.3rem/1 var(--f-body);
        transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
      }
      details[open] summary::after {
        transform: rotate(45deg);
        background: var(--brand);
        color: #fff;
      }
      details p {
        padding: 0 24px 22px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      details[open] p {
        animation: fadeUp 0.5s var(--ease);
      }
      @keyframes fadeUp {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(-6px);
        }
      }

      /* 17. CONTACTO (tarjeta degradada tipo referencia) */
      .contact {
        padding-top: 40px;
      }
      .cbox {
        border-radius: 40px;
        padding: 80px 56px;
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
        background:
          radial-gradient(600px 380px at 100% 0%, rgba(98, 182, 255, 0.45), transparent 70%),
          radial-gradient(500px 320px at 0% 100%, rgba(31, 191, 159, 0.22), transparent 70%),
          linear-gradient(170deg, var(--sky), var(--soft));
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .trust-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: -30px 0 48px;
      }
      .cgrid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: start;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .cal {
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 26px;
        overflow: hidden;
        height: 560px;
        box-shadow: var(--sh-lg);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .cal iframe {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        border: 0;
      }
      .cal-alt {
        margin-top: 14px;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .cal-alt a {
        color: var(--brand);
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      form {
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--ink);
        border-radius: 26px;
        padding: 36px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        box-shadow: var(--sh-lg);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      form h3 {
        font-size: 1.35rem;
      }
      label {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }
      input,
      select {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 13px 16px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 14px;
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.97rem;
        background: var(--soft);
        color: var(--ink);
        transition: border-color 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s, background 0.25s;
      }
      input:hover,
      select:hover {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 35%, var(--line));
      }
      input:focus,
      select:focus {
        outline: 0;
        background: var(--surface);
        border-color: var(--brand);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 16%, transparent);
      }
      form .btn {
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 4px;
      }
      .ok-msg {
        display: none;
        background: var(--mint-bg);
        color: var(--mint-ink);
        padding: 14px 18px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      /* 18. FOOTER + CTA MÓVIL */
      footer {
        padding: 56px 0 40px;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 80px;
      }
      footer .wrap {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 24px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
      }
      footer nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 6px 20px;
      }
      footer a {
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      footer a:hover {
        color: var(--brand);
      }
      .sticky-cta {
        display: none;
      }

      /* 19. RESPONSIVE
         Escala fluida (sin media query) + cortes:
         ≤1080 tablet horizontal · ≤900 tablet vertical y menú hamburguesa · ≤640 móvil · ≤400 móvil estrecho */

      /* 19.1 Tipografía fluida y protección contra desbordes */
      h1,
      h2 {
        text-wrap: balance;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 0.9rem + 5.4vw, 4.6rem);
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 1.1rem + 2.6vw, 3.1rem);
      }
      .lead {
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.95rem + 0.3vw, 1.12rem);
      }
      img,
      iframe {
        max-width: 100%;
      }
      /* Los hijos de un grid no deben imponer su ancho mínimo (evita scroll horizontal) */
      .pains > *,
      .ben-grid > *,
      .bento > *,
      .plans > *,
      .proof-grid > *,
      .demos > *,
      .faq-grid > *,
      .cgrid > *,
      .bx-hero > *,
      .bx-int > * {
        min-width: 0;
      }

      /* 19.2 Tablet horizontal */
      @media (max-width: 1080px) {
        section {
          padding: 96px 0;
        }
        .pains {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
        .demos {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
        .proof-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
        .rating {
          grid-row: auto;
          grid-column: span 2;
        }
        .quote.feat {
          grid-row: auto;
          grid-column: span 2;
          order: -1;
        }
        .fan figure:nth-child(1),
        .fan figure:nth-child(5) {
          display: none;
        }
        .float.f3 {
          left: 2%;
        }
        .bx-hero {
          gap: 24px;
        }
        .faq-grid {
          gap: 40px;
        }
      }

      /* 19.3 Tablet vertical: menú hamburguesa y rejillas a 1-2 columnas */
      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        section {
          padding: 80px 0;
        }
        .lead {
          margin-bottom: 44px;
        }

        /* Navegación */
        .links,
        .nav-cta {
          display: none;
        }
        .burger {
          display: block;
        }
        .top .nav {
          position: relative;
          z-index: 3;
          padding-right: 10px;
        }
        /* Panel a pantalla completa: fixed respecto al viewport, se abre donde esté el usuario */
        .top.open {
          z-index: 1000;
        }
        .mnav {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          position: fixed;
          inset: 0;
          width: 100%;
          height: 100vh;
          height: 100dvh;
          z-index: 1000;
          padding: calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px)) 16px calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
          overflow-y: auto;
          overscroll-behavior: contain;
          background:
            radial-gradient(500px 320px at 100% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand2) 22%, transparent), transparent 70%),
            radial-gradient(420px 300px at 0% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--mint) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%),
            var(--bg);
          opacity: 0;
          visibility: hidden;
          transform: translateY(-12px);
          transition:
            opacity 0.3s var(--ease),
            transform 0.4s var(--ease),
            visibility 0s linear 0.4s;
        }
        .top.open .mnav {
          opacity: 1;
          visibility: visible;
          transform: none;
          transition:
            opacity 0.3s var(--ease),
            transform 0.4s var(--ease),
            visibility 0s;
        }
        .mnav-head {
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: space-between;
          height: 64px;
          padding: 0 10px 0 22px;
          margin: 0 auto 28px;
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 1100px;
          border-radius: 999px;
          background: var(--surface);
          border: 1px solid var(--line);
          box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
        }
        .mnav-close {
          width: 44px;
          height: 44px;
          border-radius: 50%;
          border: 0;
          display: grid;
          place-items: center;
          background: var(--btn);
          color: var(--btn-ink);
          cursor: pointer;
          transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease);
        }
        .mnav-close:hover {
          transform: rotate(90deg);
        }
        .mnav-close:active {
          transform: scale(0.94);
        }
        .mnav-close .i {
          width: 20px;
          height: 20px;
        }
        .mnav-links {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 560px;
          margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .mnav-links a {
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: space-between;
          padding: 18px 8px;
          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
          text-decoration: none;
          font: 700 clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1.4vw, 2rem) var(--f-title);
          letter-spacing: -0.03em;
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(10px);
          transition:
            color 0.25s,
            padding 0.3s var(--ease),
            opacity 0.4s var(--ease),
            transform 0.4s var(--ease);
        }
        .top.open .mnav-links a {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: none;
        }
        .top.open .mnav-links a:nth-child(1) {
          transition-delay: 0.06s;
        }
        .top.open .mnav-links a:nth-child(2) {
          transition-delay: 0.1s;
        }
        .top.open .mnav-links a:nth-child(3) {
          transition-delay: 0.14s;
        }
        .top.open .mnav-links a:nth-child(4) {
          transition-delay: 0.18s;
        }
        .mnav-links a .i {
          color: var(--muted);
          transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease), color 0.25s;
        }
        .mnav-links a:hover,
        .mnav-links a:focus-visible {
          color: var(--brand);
          padding-left: 14px;
        }
        .mnav-links a:hover .i {
          color: var(--brand);
          transform: translateX(4px);
        }
        .mnav-foot {
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 560px;
          margin: auto auto 0;
          padding-top: 32px;
        }
        .mnav-foot .btn {
          width: 100%;
        }
        .mnav-note {
          text-align: center;
          font-size: 0.84rem;
          color: var(--muted);
          padding-top: 12px;
        }
        /* Bloquea el scroll de fondo solo en <html>: si también se aplica a <body>,
           body pasa a ser contenedor de scroll y la cabecera sticky salta arriba */
        html.menu-open {
          overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
          padding: 124px 0 24px;
        }
        .hero .sub {
          margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .stage {
          height: 430px;
          margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .halo {
          width: 520px;
          height: 520px;
        }
        .trio .p-c {
          --w: 200px;
        }
        .trio .p-l,
        .trio .p-r {
          --w: 170px;
        }
        .trio .p-l {
          transform: translateX(-122%) translateY(60px) rotate(-9deg);
        }
        .trio .p-r {
          transform: translateX(22%) translateY(60px) rotate(9deg);
        }
        .float.f1 {
          left: 0;
          top: 40px;
        }
        .float.f2 {
          right: 0;
          top: 150px;
        }
        .float.f3 {
          display: none;
        }
        .logos {
          padding: 40px 0 8px;
        }

        /* Rejillas: bento a 2 columnas, el resto a 1 */
        .bento {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
          gap: 14px;
        }
        .bento .s6,
        .bento .s4,
        .bento .s2 {
          grid-column: span 2;
        }
        .bento .s3 {
          grid-column: span 1;
        }
        .bx-dark {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
        }
        .bx-dark .tablet {
          margin-top: auto;
        }
        .bx-dark p {
          margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .bx-hero,
        .bx-int,
        .ben-grid,
        .plans,
        .faq-grid,
        .cgrid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .ben-grid {
          margin-top: 56px;
          gap: 14px;
        }
        .pains,
        .demos,
        .proof-grid {
          gap: 14px;
        }
        .audience {
          margin: -12px 0 44px;
        }
        .bridge {
          margin-top: 44px;
          font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .demos-h {
          margin: 64px 0 22px;
        }
        .faq-grid {
          gap: 32px;
        }
        .faq-side {
          position: static;
        }
        .ask {
          display: none;
        }

        /* Timeline: línea a la izquierda */
        .tl-line {
          left: 21px;
        }
        .tl-item + .tl-item {
          margin-top: 0;
        }
        .tl-item,
        .tl-item:nth-child(odd) {
          width: 100%;
          margin-left: 0;
          padding: 0 0 24px 64px;
        }
        .tl-node,
        .tl-item:nth-child(odd) .tl-node {
          left: 0;
          right: auto;
        }
        .tl-count {
          margin-top: 36px;
        }

        /* Contacto y pie */
        .contact {
          padding-top: 16px;
        }
        .cbox {
          padding: 56px 24px;
          border-radius: 28px;
        }
        .trust-row {
          margin: -16px 0 36px;
        }
        .cal {
          height: 500px;
        }
        form,
        .plan {
          padding: 28px;
        }
        footer {
          margin-top: 48px;
          padding: 40px 0 110px;
        }
        .sticky-cta {
          display: block;
          position: fixed;
          left: 0;
          right: 0;
          bottom: 0;
          z-index: 40;
          padding: 12px 16px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
          background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, transparent);
          backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
          border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
          transform: translateY(110%);
          transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease);
        }
        .sticky-cta.show {
          transform: none;
        }
        html:not(.js) .sticky-cta {
          transform: none;
        }
        html.menu-open .sticky-cta {
          transform: translateY(110%);
        }
        .sticky-cta .btn {
          width: 100%;
        }
      }

      /* 19.4 Móvil: todo a una columna fluida */
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        section {
          padding: 64px 0;
        }
        .wrap {
          padding: 0 16px;
        }
        .top {
          top: 8px;
          padding: 0 10px;
        }
        .nav,
        .top .nav {
          height: 58px;
          padding: 0 7px 0 14px;
        }
        .mnav {
          padding-left: 10px;
          padding-right: 10px;
        }
        .mnav-head {
          height: 58px;
          padding: 0 7px 0 14px;
        }
        .logo {
          font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .logo i {
          width: 32px;
          height: 32px;
          font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .eyebrow {
          margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        h2 {
          margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .lead {
          margin-bottom: 36px;
        }
        .badge em {
          display: none;
        }
        .badge {
          padding-right: 14px;
          font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
          padding: 108px 0 16px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
          margin-bottom: 18px;
          letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        }
        .hero .sub {
          font-size: 1.02rem;
          margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .cta-row {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 10px;
        }
        .cta-row .btn {
          width: 100%;
        }
        .stage {
          height: 380px;
          margin-top: 32px;
        }
        .halo {
          width: 420px;
          height: 420px;
          top: 40px;
        }
        .trio .p-c {
          --w: 176px;
        }
        .trio .p-l,
        .trio .p-r {
          --w: 146px;
        }
        .float {
          font-size: 0.72rem;
          padding: 8px 10px 8px 8px;
          gap: 8px;
        }
        .float b {
          font-size: 0.78rem;
        }
        .float .ico {
          width: 28px;
          height: 28px;
        }
        .float.f1 {
          top: 10px;
        }
        .float.f2 {
          top: 250px;
        }
        .ticker-t {
          margin-top: 16px;
        }
        .pill {
          padding: 8px 14px;
          font-size: 0.84rem;
        }
        .logos .track {
          gap: 36px;
        }
        .lg {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* Rejillas a una sola columna */
        .pains,
        .proof-grid,
        .bento {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .rating {
          grid-column: auto;
        }
        .demos {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
          gap: 10px;
        }
        .demo,
        .demos .card {
          padding: 8px 8px 12px;
          border-radius: 18px;
        }
        .browser {
          margin-bottom: 10px;
          border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .demo b {
          font-size: 0.82rem;
          line-height: 1.3;
          gap: 6px;
          padding: 0 4px;
        }
        .bento .s2,
        .bento .s3,
        .bento .s4,
        .bento .s6 {
          grid-column: auto;
        }
        .quote.feat {
          grid-column: auto;
        }
        .card,
        .bento .card,
        .pains .card {
          padding: 22px;
          border-radius: 22px;
        }
        .card h3 {
          font-size: 1.16rem;
        }
        .mini {
          min-height: 0;
          margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .audience {
          gap: 8px;
          margin: -8px 0 32px;
        }
        .audience span {
          padding: 6px 12px;
          font-size: 0.84rem;
        }
        .bridge {
          margin-top: 32px;
          font-size: 1.08rem;
        }

        /* Abanico de móviles */
        .fan {
          padding-top: 10px;
        }
        .fan figure:nth-child(2) .iphone,
        .fan figure:nth-child(4) .iphone {
          --w: 130px;
        }
        .fan figure:nth-child(3) .iphone {
          --w: 160px;
        }
        .fan figure {
          margin: 0 -14px;
        }
        .fan figure:nth-child(2) {
          transform: translateY(24px) rotate(-3deg);
        }
        .fan figure:nth-child(4) {
          transform: translateY(24px) rotate(3deg);
        }
        .fan figcaption {
          font-size: 0.72rem;
          padding: 6px 10px;
          margin-top: 12px;
        }
        .ben-grid {
          margin-top: 40px;
        }

        /* Bento con dispositivos */
        .dev-stack {
          padding: 0 20px 16px 0;
        }
        .dev-stack .iphone {
          --w: 92px;
        }
        .kpis {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
        .kpi:nth-child(3) {
          display: none;
        }
        .bx-dark .tablet {
          margin-top: 20px;
          border-radius: 20px;
          padding: 8px;
        }
        .tscr {
          border-radius: 14px;
        }
        /* Integraciones: de órbita a etiquetas en fila */
        .hub {
          height: auto;
          display: flex;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          gap: 8px;
          margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .hub .ring,
        .hub .core {
          display: none;
        }
        .hub .pill,
        .hub .pill:nth-of-type(n) {
          position: static;
          transform: none;
          font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
        .opt {
          margin-top: 20px;
          font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Timeline */
        .tl-line {
          left: 17px;
        }
        .tl-item,
        .tl-item:nth-child(odd) {
          padding: 0 0 18px 50px;
        }
        .tl-node {
          top: 22px;
          width: 36px;
          height: 36px;
          font-size: 0.82rem;
        }

        /* Planes, opiniones y FAQ */
        .plan,
        form {
          padding: 24px;
        }
        .price {
          font-size: 2.2rem;
        }
        .rating .score {
          font-size: 3.8rem;
        }
        .quote.feat blockquote {
          margin: 14px 0 24px;
        }
        .demos-h {
          margin: 48px 0 18px;
        }
        .demos-h h3 {
          font-size: 1.3rem;
        }
        summary {
          padding: 17px 56px 17px 18px;
          font-size: 0.98rem;
        }
        summary::after {
          right: 14px;
        }
        details p {
          padding: 0 18px 18px;
        }
        details:hover {
          transform: none;
        }

        /* Contacto y pie */
        .cbox {
          padding: 44px 14px 14px;
          border-radius: 24px;
        }
        .trust-row {
          margin: -8px 0 28px;
          gap: 8px;
        }
        .trust-row .pill {
          font-size: 0.78rem;
          padding: 7px 12px;
        }
        .cgrid {
          gap: 16px;
        }
        .cal {
          height: 460px;
          border-radius: 20px;
        }
        .cal-alt {
          padding: 0 6px;
        }
        footer {
          margin-top: 32px;
        }
        footer .wrap {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: 16px;
        }
      }

      /* 19.5 Móvil estrecho (≤400 px, p. ej. iPhone SE) */
      @media (max-width: 400px) {
        .stage {
          height: 340px;
        }
        .trio .p-c {
          --w: 156px;
        }
        .trio .p-l,
        .trio .p-r {
          --w: 128px;
        }
        .float.f2 {
          top: 220px;
        }
        .fan figure:nth-child(2) .iphone,
        .fan figure:nth-child(4) .iphone {
          --w: 112px;
        }
        .fan figure:nth-child(3) .iphone {
          --w: 138px;
        }
        .fan figure {
          margin: 0 -12px;
        }
        .fan figcaption .i {
          display: none;
        }
        .btn {
          padding: 14px 18px;
          font-size: 0.92rem;
          gap: 8px;
        }
      }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          animation: none !important;
          transition: none !important;
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        }
        html.js .rv,
        .tl-card {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <!-- HTML-1 · NAVEGACIÓN -->
    <header class="top" id="top">
      <div class="nav">
        <a class="logo" href="#"><i>MN</i><span>Design Web</span></a>
        <nav class="links" aria-label="Secciones">
          <a href="#funciones">Funciones</a>
          <a href="#proceso">Proceso</a>
          <a href="#planes">Planes</a>
          <a href="#opiniones">Opiniones</a>
        </nav>
        <a class="btn btn-main btn-sm nav-cta" href="#contacto">
          Agendar llamada <svg class="i i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.arrow} />
        </a>
        <!-- Botón hamburguesa (solo tablet/móvil) -->
        <button class="burger" id="burger" type="button" aria-label="Abrir menú" aria-controls="mnav" aria-expanded="false">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Panel de menú móvil: capa fija a pantalla completa -->
      <nav class="mnav" id="mnav" aria-label="Menú móvil">
        <div class="mnav-head">
          <a class="logo" href="#"><i>MN</i><span>Design Web</span></a>
          <button class="mnav-close" id="mnav-close" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar menú">
            <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.plus} style="transform:rotate(45deg)" />
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="mnav-links">
          <a href="#funciones"><span>Funciones</span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.arrow} /></a>
          <a href="#proceso"><span>Proceso</span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.arrow} /></a>
          <a href="#planes"><span>Planes</span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.arrow} /></a>
          <a href="#opiniones"><span>Opiniones</span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.arrow} /></a>
        </div>
        <div class="mnav-foot">
          <a class="btn btn-main" href="#contacto">
            Agendar llamada gratuita <svg class="i i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.arrow} />
          </a>
          <p class="mnav-note">Sin compromiso · Respuesta en menos de 24 h</p>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- HTML-2 · HERO centrado + trío de móviles superpuestos -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap">
          <h1 class="rv" style="--d:.08s">
            Que tus pacientes reserven solos y tú vuelvas a <span class="grad">centrarte en terapia</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="sub rv" style="--d:.16s">
            Diseño tu web profesional con agenda online, videoconsulta cifrada y RGPD incluido. Sin plantillas, sin
            mensajes interminables para cuadrar horarios.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row rv" style="--d:.24s">
            <a class="btn btn-main" href="#contacto">
              Agendar llamada gratuita de 30 min <svg class="i i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.arrow} />
            </a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#demos">
              <span class="play"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.play} /></span> Ver webs reales
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="micro rv" style="--d:.3s">Sin compromiso · Te respondo personalmente en menos de 24 h · 3-5 semanas de idea a web</p>

          <!-- Escenario de mockups. Cada .scr admite una <img> real en lugar del UI de ejemplo -->
          <div class="stage rv" style="--d:.35s" aria-label="Ejemplo del portal: agenda del profesional, portal del paciente y reserva online">
            <div class="halo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="trio" id="trio">
              <!-- Móvil izquierdo · agenda del profesional -->
              <div class="iphone p-l" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="scr">
                  <div class="sb"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div>
                  <small>Jueves, 12 de junio</small>
                  <h4>Agenda de hoy</h4>
                  <div class="ui-card">
                    <div class="ui-row"><time>10:00</time><b>Primera sesión</b><span class="tag ok">Pagada</span></div>
                    <div class="ui-row"><time>11:30</time><b>Seguimiento</b><span class="tag">Online</span></div>
                    <div class="ui-row"><time>13:00</time><b style="color:#8a98ab">Hueco libre</b></div>
                    <div class="ui-row"><time>17:00</time><b>Pareja</b><span class="tag ok">Recordada</span></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ui-card" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.8em">
                    <span><b style="font-size:1.4em;display:block">8</b>citas hoy</span>
                    <span><b style="font-size:1.4em;display:block">0</b>mensajes</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Móvil central · portal del paciente -->
              <div class="iphone p-c" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="scr">
                  <div class="sb"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div>
                  <small>Hola, Laura 👋</small>
                  <h4>Tu espacio de terapia</h4>
                  <div class="next">
                    <small>Próxima sesión</small><b>Jueves · 10:00</b>
                    <span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.video} /> Entrar a videoconsulta</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ui-card">
                    <div class="ui-row"><b>Cuestionario previo</b><span class="tag ok">✓</span></div>
                    <div class="ui-row"><b>Consentimiento firmado</b><span class="tag ok">✓</span></div>
                    <div class="ui-row"><b>Factura de mayo</b><span class="tag">PDF</span></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Móvil derecho · reserva -->
              <div class="iphone p-r" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="scr">
                  <div class="sb"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div>
                  <small>Reserva tu sesión</small>
                  <h4>Elige día y hora</h4>
                  <div class="days">
                    <span>Lu<b>9</b></span><span>Ma<b>10</b></span><span class="on">Mi<b>11</b></span><span>Ju<b>12</b></span><span>Vi<b>13</b></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="slots">
                    <span class="off">09:00</span><span>10:00</span><span class="on">11:30</span><span>13:00</span><span class="off">16:00</span><span>17:00</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="ui-btn">Confirmar · 60 €</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="float f1" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="ico"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.cal} /></span>
              <div><b>Nueva reserva</b><span>Miércoles · 11:30</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="float f2" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="ico"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.check} /></span>
              <div><b>Recordatorio enviado</b><span>24 h antes, automático</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="float f3" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="ico"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.lock} /></span>
              <div><b>Cifrado extremo a extremo</b><span>RGPD sanitario</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-fade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>

          <p class="ticker-t">Todo lo que incluye tu consulta digital</p>
          <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="track">
              {[...features, ...features].map(([k, t]) => (
                <span class="pill"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic[k]} />{t}</span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- HTML-3 · TIRA DE LOGOS (PLACEHOLDERS: sustituir por logos reales con permiso) -->
      <div class="logos">
        <div class="wrap">
          <p>Consultas y centros que ya trabajan con su agenda automatizada</p>
          <div class="marquee">
            <div class="track">
              {[...logos, ...logos].map((l, idx) => (
                <span class="lg" aria-hidden={idx >= logos.length ? 'true' : undefined}>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={shapes[l.shape]} />{l.name}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- HTML-4 · PROBLEMA (titular centrado + tarjetas con mini-visual) -->
      <section class="center">
        <div class="wrap">
          <span class="eyebrow rv">El problema</span>
          <h2 class="rv">
            Si tu web te da trabajo <span class="muted-word">en lugar de quitártelo,</span> <span class="grad">hay un problema</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="lead rv">Esto es lo que nos cuentan la mayoría de psicólogos antes de empezar.</p>
          <div class="audience rv" aria-label="Para quién es">
            <span># Psicología clínica</span><span># Terapia de pareja</span><span># Infanto-juvenil</span><span
              ># Terapia online</span
            ><span># Centros con varios profesionales</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pains">
            {pains.map((p, idx) => (
              <article class="card rv" data-spot style={`--d:${idx * 0.08}s`}>
                {p.v === 'chat' && (
                  <div class="mini" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="bub">¿Tienes hueco esta semana?</div>
                    <div class="bub out">Martes a las 10, ¿te va?</div>
                    <div class="bub">Uf, mejor jueves…</div>
                    <div class="bub out">Jueves solo a las 17:00</div>
                  </div>
                )}
                {p.v === 'miss' && (
                  <div class="mini" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="slot x"><s>Lun 10:00</s><span class="tag warn">Ausencia</span></div>
                    <div class="slot"><span>Mié 11:30</span><span class="tag ok">Recordado</span></div>
                    <div class="slot"><span>Jue 17:00</span><span class="tag ok">Pagado</span></div>
                  </div>
                )}
                {p.v === 'wf' && (
                  <div class="mini" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="wfm"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><small>Plantilla genérica · igual que otras 1.000 webs</small></div>
                  </div>
                )}
                {p.v === 'lock' && (
                  <div class="mini lockv" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="big"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.lock} /></span>
                    <span class="tag warn">WhatsApp y formularios sin cifrar</span>
                  </div>
                )}
                <h3>{p.t}</h3>
                <p>{p.p}</p>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="bridge rv">Todo esto se resuelve con una web bien pensada. <span class="grad">Así es como la construimos.</span></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- HTML-5 · BENEFICIOS: abanico de 5 móviles (cada pantalla = una función) -->
      <section class="benefits center" id="funciones">
        <div class="wrap">
          <span class="eyebrow rv">Beneficios</span>
          <h2 class="rv">Tu consulta, <span class="grad">funcionando sola</span> en el bolsillo de cada paciente</h2>
          <p class="lead rv">Reservar, recordar, cobrar, firmar y conectar: cinco pasos que hoy haces a mano y mañana ocurren solos.</p>

          <div class="fan rv">
            <figure>
              <div class="iphone">
                <div class="scr">
                  <div class="sb"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div>
                  <small>Paso 1</small>
                  <h4>Reserva online</h4>
                  <div class="days">
                    <span>Lu<b>9</b></span><span class="on">Ma<b>10</b></span><span>Mi<b>11</b></span><span>Ju<b>12</b></span><span>Vi<b>13</b></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="slots">
                    <span>10:00</span><span class="on">11:30</span><span class="off">13:00</span><span>17:00</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="ui-btn">Reservar</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <figcaption><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.cal} />Reservas</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <div class="iphone">
                <div class="scr lock">
                  <div class="sb"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div>
                  <div class="clock-big">9:41</div>
                  <div class="date">Miércoles, 11 de junio</div>
                  <div class="noti">
                    <i><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.bell} /></i>
                    <div><b>Mañana, 11:30</b><span>Tu sesión con Laura. ¿Confirmas?</span></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="noti">
                    <i style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1fbf9f,#52d6b8)"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.check} /></i>
                    <div><b>Asistencia confirmada</b><span>Hace 2 min</span></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <figcaption><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.bell} />Recordatorios</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <div class="iphone">
                <div class="scr vid">
                  <div class="vid-main"><span class="av-big">MN</span></div>
                  <div class="vid-self">L</div>
                  <div class="vid-top">
                    <b>Sesión · 50 min</b>
                    <span class="e2e"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.lock} />Cifrada</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="vid-ctrl">
                    <span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.video} /></span>
                    <span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.chat} /></span>
                    <span class="end"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.plus} style="transform:rotate(45deg)" /></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <figcaption><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.video} />Videoconsulta</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <div class="iphone">
                <div class="scr">
                  <div class="sb"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div>
                  <small>Sesión individual · 50 min</small>
                  <div class="pay-ok"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.check} /></div>
                  <div class="pay-amt">60,00 €</div>
                  <p style="text-align:center;font-size:.8em;color:#6b7a90;margin-bottom:1em">Pago completado</p>
                  <div class="ui-card">
                    <div class="ui-row"><b>Bono 4 sesiones</b><span class="tag">Activo</span></div>
                    <div class="ui-row"><b>Factura</b><span class="tag ok">Enviada</span></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <figcaption><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.card} />Cobros</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <div class="iphone">
                <div class="scr">
                  <div class="sb"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div>
                  <small>Antes de tu primera sesión</small>
                  <h4>Admisión</h4>
                  <div class="field"><small>Motivo de consulta</small><b>Ansiedad</b></div>
                  <div class="field"><small>Modalidad</small><b>Online</b></div>
                  <div class="sign">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 120 40"><path d="M6 28c10-18 18-20 20-8s6 14 14-2 12-10 14 0 10 8 18-6 14-6 20 4 12 6 22-2" /></svg>
                  </div>
                  <span class="ui-btn">Firmar consentimiento</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <figcaption><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.file} />Admisión</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <p class="cap-note">Pantallas de ejemplo ilustrativas del portal.</p>

          <div class="ben-grid" style="text-align:left">
            <article class="card rv" data-spot>
              <span class="ico-box"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.clock} /></span>
              <h3>Recuperas horas cada semana</h3>
              <p>Tus pacientes ven tu disponibilidad real y reservan solos. Adiós al ping-pong de mensajes.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card rv" data-spot style="--d:.08s">
              <span class="ico-box"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={ic.bell} /></span>
              <h3>Menos huecos sin cobrar</h3>
              <p>Recordatorios automáticos y pago previo para que cada hora de tu agenda cuente.</p>
            </article>
